    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Collaborative Editor (Google Docs)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Let many people type into the same document at the same moment, see each other's letters and cursors appear live, never lose a word, and end up with exactly the same text on every screen - and be able to explain OT versus CRDT on a whiteboard.</p>\n      "
